      "note": "deployment-basis recheck (storage, not events): the Governance proxy's single DELEGATECALL in the attack tx goes to 0x35dd16dfa4ea1522c29ddd087e8f076cad0ae5e8, and the EIP-1967 implementation slot holds exactly that address at the creation block 11103280, at the incident block 15201799 and at all 201 evenly spaced samples in between; the proxy runtime is byte-identical at both blocks. The current implementation 0x1c91af03a390b4c619b444425b3119e553b5b44b was installed only after the hack. The age is therefore not overstated: 639.9 days from deployment is the real figure."
